    "description": "Cross\nModel 3502 Lustrous Chrome Ballpoint Pens\nLot of 2\nOriginal Boxes and Instructions Included\nThe Cross Century is a definitive classic of American industrial design, celebrated for its slim, elegant profile and legendary reliability. These model 3502 ballpoint pens feature the signature lustrous chrome finish with subtle incised line patterns that provide both visual texture and a secure grip. A staple of professional stationery since 1946, these pens utilize a smooth twist-action mechanism and represent the enduring quality of the Cross brand.\nSet of two ballpoint pens with polished chrome appointments\nIconic slim silhouette with signature conical top\nPersonalized barrel engravings: \"JIM\" and \"PHILLIP\"\nIncludes original presentation boxes, sleeves, and guarantee documents\nModel: 3502 Chrome, Made in USA\nCondition:\nVery good overall condition with average wear consistent with gentle use. The chrome finish remains bright with minor surface micro-scratching. Both pens are personalized with engraved names as noted. Mechanisms have been tested and are fully functional.",
